

<div id="box2">
	<div class="equiwrapper">
		<!-- 	<p style="padding-top: 2em;padding-left:3em; color: grey;font-family: myFirstFont;">EQUILIBerrATIONS 2007</p><br> -->

		<div class="videoscontainer">
			<p style="padding-top: 2em; padding-left:0em; color: grey;font-family: myFirstFont;">Metapolis 2006</p><br>

			<img src="/img/Install/metapolis/META2b.jpg" style="width:20em; cursor:pointer; padding-top:0em;"
			onclick="onThumbnailClick(null, 'meta1');"  class="w3-hover-opacity"><br>
			<div id="meta1" class="w3-modal" onclick="onModelCancelClick(this);">>
				<span class="w3-button w3-hover-red w3-xlarge w3-display-topright">&times;</span>
				<div style="background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0);"	class="w3-modal-content w3-animate-zoom">
					<img style="width:50%" src="/img/Install/metapolis/META2b.jpg" >
				</div>
			</div>
			


			<img src='/img/Install/metapolis/META1b.jpg'style="width:20em; cursor:pointer; padding-top:3em;"
			onclick="onThumbnailClick(null, 'poli2');"  class="w3-hover-opacity">
			<div id="poli2" class="w3-modal" onclick="onModelCancelClick(this);">>
				<span class="w3-button w3-hover-red w3-xlarge w3-display-topright">&times;</span>
				<div style="background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0);"	class="w3-modal-content w3-animate-zoom">
					<img style="width:50%" src="/img/Install/metapolis/META1b.jpg" >
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>
	

		<div class="text" style="padding-top:6em;load="loadImage()">
			<p style="line-height:1.8;"><br>
				<span>PREMISES</span><br>
				:: PASS-THROUGH ZONE ALONG SERVICE AREAS OF ACTIVE NEARBY RESTAURANTS, PARKING LOTS, GARBAGE.<br>:: SHIFTING BUILDING FUNCTIONS- DEFUNCT THEATER AND LIBRARY.<br>:: REAWAKEN MEMORY OF UNDERGROUND STREAM.<br>:: RICHNESS OF OVERLAYING SURFACES, COLORS, FUNCTIONS.<br>
				<span>GOALS</span>
				<br>:: NON-PASSIVE PASSING BY.<br>:: REDIRECT ATTENTION TO COMPLEXITY OF SITE LAYERS.<br>:: CATALYZE BEHAVIORAL PATTERN SHIFTS.<br>:: CURIOSITY IN REWALKING-RESURFACING.<br>:: REAWAKEN MEMORY OF THE PLACE.<br>:: ADAPTIVE DEPLOYMENT ACCORDING TO SITE CONDITIONS.<br>:: CONTINUOUS TRANSITION BETWEEN GROUND AND WALLS SURFACES.<br>:: INTERPLAY BETWEEN LIGHT AND SHADOW.<br>
				<span>DESIGN</span>
				<br>:: STAGING INTERACTIVE LIGHT AND SOUND RESURFACING MEMORY OF THEATER AND WATER STREAM.<br>:: RANDOMIZED PROGRESSION OF SIMPLE FOLDING SURFACE ALLOWS ADAPTIVE DEPLOYMENT.<br>:: FLEXIBILITY WITHIN SIMPLE INITIAL GEOMETRIES THROUGH VARIABLE  REARANGEMENTS OF TOPOLOGIES.<br>:: OPEN AND EXPANSIVE GEOMETRIES SUGGESTIVE OF ORGANIC GROUTH, PUZZLE PASSING-BY.<br>
				<span>IMPLEMENTATION</span>
				<br>:: FOOTSTEPS ARE CONVERT INTO LIGHTS AND SOUNDS THROUGH PRESSURE SENSORS.<br>:: RUBBER-METAL QUILT HOSTS ELECTRONIC EQUIPMENT.<br>:: FLEXIBLE AND OPEN.  
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>




<div id="box2" style="padding-top:2em;">
	<div class="equiwrapper1" >



			<% @metapolis.each do |project| %>
			
			<div class='equiicon2'>
				<img style="width:14em; height: 10em; cursor:pointer;" src="<%= project[:thumbnail]%>"
				onclick="onThumbnailClick(null, '<%= project[:item_anchor] %>');"  class="w3-hover-opacity">
			</div>
			<div id="<%= project[:item_anchor] %>" class="w3-modal" onclick="onModelCancelClick(this);">
				<span class="w3-button w3-hover-red w3-xlarge w3-display-topright">&times;</span>
			<div style="background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0);" class="w3-modal-content w3-animate-zoom">
					<img style="width:70%"  src="<%= project[:image] %>">
			</div>
			</div>
			<%end%>
	</div>
</div>





